WEBVTT

00:00:03.230 --> 00:00:05.720
No, you can't do that!

00:00:10.630 --> 00:00:12.600
Ayukawa!

00:00:22.580 --> 00:00:24.560
At that moment I was...

00:00:24.560 --> 00:00:26.760
...I was furiously trying my best to...

00:00:26.760 --> 00:00:30.010
...convince myself that
what I was doing was justified.

00:00:42.270 --> 00:00:48.960
As I tried to kiss you, as if to avoid me...

00:00:48.960 --> 00:00:56.770
...with your T-Shirt on,
you dove into the shining sea...

00:00:56.770 --> 00:01:03.140
The white flower petals on your soaking skirt...

00:01:03.140 --> 00:01:09.710
