00:01:09.710 --> 00:01:18.730
Tell me why, when you winked...

00:01:18.730 --> 00:01:26.670
...to tell me that you'd be mine...

00:01:26.670 --> 00:01:31.340
Oh Baby, Tell Me, Tell Me -
You're unpredictable...

00:01:31.340 --> 00:01:34.640
'Tell me you love me,
Tell me that you need me...

00:01:34.640 --> 00:01:38.550
Tell Me, Tell Me,
...my Angel of the Summer...

00:01:38.550 --> 00:01:41.150
'Tell me, lover, Tell me that you need me...

00:01:41.150 --> 00:01:45.690
Oh Baby, Tell Me, Tell Me -
I know that you're in love...

00:01:45.690 --> 00:01:49.090
'Tell me you love me,
Tell me that you need me...

00:01:49.090 --> 00:01:55.600
Tell Me, Tell Me - but you're a mystery.

00:02:06.660 --> 00:02:10.270
Roots Panic! Madoka in the Mysterious Homeland.

00:02:10.270 --> 00:02:15.160
"Far into Autumn... Is the mountain changing its... attire?"

00:02:15.270 --> 00:02:18.880
-- by Kyosuke. Just kidding!

00:02:18.880 --> 00:02:23.180
I received a letter from my Grandpa inviting us to visit...

00:02:23.180 --> 00:02:26.830
...since there was going to be a festival there.

00:02:26.830 --> 00:02:32.950
And so we've come to hike around this Autumn-cloaked mountain.

00:03:07.260 --> 00:03:08.260
It's so refreshing here!

00:03:08.260 --> 00:03:11.230
Darling, is something wrong?
It's so refreshing here!

00:03:12.730 --> 00:03:15.700
