00:03:17.600 --> 00:03:19.860
That's gotta be Grandpa and Grandma!

00:03:20.370 --> 00:03:22.340
Geez, man, there's nothing there!

00:03:22.340 --> 00:03:25.080
Darling! Darling, are you breathing?!
Geez, man, there's nothing there!

00:03:25.080 --> 00:03:26.880
Kasuga, what's wrong?
Darling! Darling, are you breathing?!

00:03:26.880 --> 00:03:27.010
Kasuga, what's wrong?

00:03:27.010 --> 00:03:30.710
Huh? O...Oh...
Kasuga, what's wrong?

00:03:30.710 --> 00:03:30.800
Kasuga, what's wrong?

00:03:30.800 --> 00:03:35.870
Well! Y'know, the sky is so beautiful
that it mesmerized me for a moment!

00:03:36.390 --> 00:03:39.000
