00:03:39.000 --> 00:03:39.920
Who knows...?

00:03:39.920 --> 00:03:42.080
Oh, yeah!
Who knows...?

00:03:42.080 --> 00:03:42.170
Who knows...?

00:03:42.170 --> 00:03:45.230
Darling, what's wrong?!

