00:08:42.990 --> 00:08:46.380
Are we clear on that?! Grandpa? Grandma?

00:08:46.380 --> 00:08:46.660
Y...Yes!

00:08:46.660 --> 00:08:48.630
Y...Yes!
Y...Yes!

00:08:50.600 --> 00:08:53.100
Oh, Baasan, he's such a pain!

00:08:53.100 --> 00:08:53.910
Uh-huh!

00:08:53.910 --> 00:08:54.660
