00:16:34.370 --> 00:16:36.340
Jingoro!

00:16:42.380 --> 00:16:43.210
Jingoro!

00:16:43.210 --> 00:16:45.180
Jingoro!
Jingoro!

00:17:12.240 --> 00:17:14.850
