00:17:14.850 --> 00:17:16.910
Jingoro!

00:17:21.880 --> 00:17:24.240
Hikaru! Yuusaku! You go look on the other side of the river!

00:17:24.240 --> 00:17:24.450
Sure!

00:17:24.450 --> 00:17:24.880
Sure!
Sure!

00:17:24.880 --> 00:17:24.970
Sure!

